WEBVTT

00:06:26.716 --> 00:06:33.036
A comprehensive government system
is key to distribute responsibility

00:06:33.076 --> 00:06:37.076
and to keep the responsible
entity accountable.

00:06:37.676 --> 00:06:42.716
An important point is
that every agency will have to report

00:06:42.756 --> 00:06:45.956
on the status of all their climate work

00:06:45.956 --> 00:06:48.716
as a part of the ordinary budget process

00:06:48.716 --> 00:06:50.876
three times a year.

00:06:51.436 --> 00:06:54.396
So let me go back to construction.

00:06:54.836 --> 00:06:56.036
Three years ago,

00:06:56.076 --> 00:06:58.356
we broke ground on the piloting

00:06:58.356 --> 00:07:02.596
of the world’s first
zero-emission construction site.